<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<workout_file>
  <author>Gravel God Training</author>
  <name>Endurance</name>
  <description>FUEL:
Target 61g carbs/hr. Practice this prescription.

WARM-UP:
- 10min building from Z1 into the Z2 target

MAIN SET:
- 80min @ 69% FTP (Z2, RPE 3)
- Position: Alternate every 30 min: drops (aero) → hoods (power)
- Cadence: self-selected, comfortable endurance cadence

COOL-DOWN:
- 10min easy spin Z1-Z2 (RPE 3-4)</description>
  <sportType>bike</sportType>
  <workout>
    <Warmup Duration="600" PowerLow="0.50" PowerHigh="0.65" />
    <SteadyState Duration="4800" Power="0.69" />
    <Cooldown Duration="600" PowerLow="0.69" PowerHigh="0.45" />
  </workout>
</workout_file>